# Onboard parameters for Vehicle 1
#
# PASS 2 of 2 — load AFTER pass 1 and a reboot. PX4 only instantiates a port's
# baud parameter once a module that declares a CONFIGURABLE baud claims it, so
# these do not exist on a fresh flash and a pass-1 write of them is dropped.
#
# There is deliberately no SER_TEL3_BAUD here. The tfmini driver declares no
# baudrate in its module.yaml and hardcodes B115200 (TFMINI.cpp:109), so PX4
# never creates that parameter for a TELEM3 assigned to it. 115200 is also what
# ArduPilot used (SERIAL2_BAUD 115), so the rate already matches.
#
# Vehicle-Id Component-Id Name Value Type
1	1	SER_TEL2_BAUD	921600	6
1	1	UXRCE_DDS_SYNCT	1	6
